@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Direct latest latency sample
GET {{baseUrl}}/telemetry

### MCP latency sample tool
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_latency_sample"
  }
}
